### Fingerprinted static asset: cache "forever" — a new build produces a new file name
GET /assets/app.3f9c2b1e.js HTTP/2
Host: shop.example.com

HTTP/2 200
Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
Content-Type: text/javascript
ETag: "3f9c2b1e"

### HTML page: browsers revalidate every time, the CDN may keep it 60 s and serve stale while refreshing
GET /products/42 HTTP/2

HTTP/2 200
Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, s-maxage=60, stale-while-revalidate=300, stale-if-error=86400
Vary: Accept-Encoding
Surrogate-Key: product-42 category-7

### Personalised API response: never stored in a shared cache
GET /api/cart HTTP/2
Cookie: session=…

HTTP/2 200
Cache-Control: private, no-store

### Revalidation: unchanged content costs a 304 with no body
GET /products/42 HTTP/2
If-None-Match: "v17"

HTTP/2 304
ETag: "v17"
